      "body": "As far as I know the cookie banner can be removed entirely (or disabled by default). NamelessMC only sets functional cookies (like the PHP session id).\r\n\r\n> To comply [...] you must: [...] Receive users’ consent before you use any cookies **except strictly necessary cookies**.\r\n\r\n> Strictly necessary cookies — These cookies are essential for you to browse the website and use its features, such as accessing secure areas of the site. Cookies that allow web shops to hold your items in your cart while you are shopping online are an example of strictly necessary cookies. These cookies will generally be first-party session cookies. While **it is not required to obtain consent for these cookies**, what they do and why they are necessary should be explained to the user.\r\n\r\nhttps://gdpr.eu/cookies/",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "pin": null,
