      "body": "\r\n__cfduid | .discord.com\r\n-- | --\r\n(NamelessMC Integration)\r\n\r\n__cfduid | .discordapp.com\r\n-- | --\r\n(NamelessMC Integration)\r\n\r\n__cfduid | .surgeplay.com \r\n-- | --\r\n(NamelessMC Integration) (Avatar)\r\n\r\nlang | cdn.syndication.twimg.com\r\n-- | --\r\n(NamelessMC Integration)\r\n\r\nYouTube cookie by inserting a link in the editor, the video is embedded and sets a cookie when opened.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
