      "body": "Information about `__cfduid`: https://support.cloudflare.com/hc/en-us/articles/200170156-Understanding-the-Cloudflare-Cookies\r\nThis cookie will be removed soon: https://blog.cloudflare.com/deprecating-cfduid-cookie/\r\n\r\nThe twitter `lang` cookie sounds like it's for remembering language settings, which would fall under functional cookies (consent not required)",
