      "body": "If I turn off Discord in StaffCP, the cookie is not set.\r\nDiscord itself uses Cloudflare.\r\n\r\nCookies are set that the user has not agreed to.\r\n\r\nI would have to disable almost all the features that NameLessMC offers so that it would be compliant.\r\nBut in the state unfortunately not.\r\n\r\nThat's right with Twitter, I just checked it again...\r\n\r\nDiscord and the avatar service but unfortunately not.\r\n\r\nIn Germany, the risk of receiving a warning is unfortunately very high.\r\n",
